<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2025-09-12T06:31:15+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Fri, 12 Sep 2025 06:31:15 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title>Jair Bolsonaro sentenced to 27 years: Brazil's Supreme Court convicts ex-president for coup attempt; US slams 'witch hunt'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123840635.cms" /&gt;Jair Bolsonaro, the former president of Brazil, has been sentenced to 27 years and three months in prison after being convicted by the Supreme Court for attempting a coup following his 2022 electoral defeat. The unprecedented ruling has sparked international backlash, particularly from the US, while inflaming political tensions within Brazil, with supporters claiming political persecution. Despite the ruling, Bolsonaro remains an influential figure.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/jair-bolsonaro-sentenced-to-27-years-brazils-supreme-court-convicts-ex-president-for-coup-attempt-us-slams-witch-hunt/articleshow/123840635.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/jair-bolsonaro-sentenced-to-27-years-brazils-supreme-court-convicts-ex-president-for-coup-attempt-us-slams-witch-hunt/articleshow/123840635.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T05:36:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123840638,imgsize-569231.cms"/></item><item><title>Watch: Donald Trump booed at Yankee stadium in New York; echoes of US Open jeers</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123840601.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-donald-trump-booed-at-yankee-stadium-in-new-york-echoes-of-us-open-jeers/articleshow/123840601.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-donald-trump-booed-at-yankee-stadium-in-new-york-echoes-of-us-open-jeers/articleshow/123840601.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T05:42:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123840644,imgsize-52710.cms"/></item><item><title>'Charlie Kirk murder: Trump urges calm after ally's assassination; remembers him as 'advocate of nonviolence'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123840435.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-murder-trump-urges-calm-after-allys-assassination-remembers-him-as-advocate-of-nonviolence/articleshow/123840435.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-murder-trump-urges-calm-after-allys-assassination-remembers-him-as-advocate-of-nonviolence/articleshow/123840435.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T04:05:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123840459,imgsize-600467.cms"/></item><item><title>'This place belongs to us': Israel PM Netanyahu clears stance; vows 'there'll be no' Palestinian state</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123838658.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/this-place-belongs-to-us-israel-pm-netanyahu-clears-stance-vows-therell-be-no-palestinian-state/articleshow/123838658.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/this-place-belongs-to-us-israel-pm-netanyahu-clears-stance-vows-therell-be-no-palestinian-state/articleshow/123838658.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T03:33:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123838701,imgsize-437144.cms"/></item><item><title>Bolsonaro Coup trial: Brazil SC votes to convict ex-president; could face 40 years in jail</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123837882.cms" /&gt;Brazil's Supreme Court has secured a majority to convict ex-president Jair Bolsonaro for plotting a coup following his 2022 election loss to Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva. Judge Carmen Lucia's vote contributed to the decision, potentially leading to a lengthy prison sentence for Bolsonaro, who faces charges including leading a criminal organization.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/bolsonaro-coup-trial-brazil-sc-votes-to-convict-ex-president-faces-40-year-jail-term/articleshow/123837882.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/bolsonaro-coup-trial-brazil-sc-votes-to-convict-ex-president-faces-40-year-jail-term/articleshow/123837882.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T00:55:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123838021,imgsize-34350.cms"/></item><item><title>'Abortion worse than Holocaust': Charlie Kirk's controversial views resurface; opposed terminations even in extreme cases</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123837800.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/abortion-worse-than-holocaust-charlie-kirks-controversial-views-resurface-opposed-terminations-even-in-extreme-cases/articleshow/123837800.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/abortion-worse-than-holocaust-charlie-kirks-controversial-views-resurface-opposed-terminations-even-in-extreme-cases/articleshow/123837800.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T00:54:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123837840,imgsize-1125341.cms"/></item><item><title>Nano Banana AI viral trend: What is Gemini's new AI feature creating 3D figurines</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123836184.cms" /&gt;The Nano Banana trend, fueled by Google's Gemini 2.5 Flash Image, has exploded across social media. This AI-powered tool allows users to effortlessly create hyper-realistic, miniature 3D figurines from photos or creative prompts. The craze's virality stems from its simplicity, creative flexibility, and instant shareability, empowering users to showcase unique virtual collectibles across various platforms.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nano-banana-ai-viral-trend-what-is-geminis-new-ai-feature-creating-3d-figurines/articleshow/123836184.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/nano-banana-ai-viral-trend-what-is-geminis-new-ai-feature-creating-3d-figurines/articleshow/123836184.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T00:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123836189,imgsize-47818.cms"/></item><item><title>Charlie Kirk murder: Trump ally's casket to be flown to Arizona on Air Force Two; Vance to escort</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123836109.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-murder-trump-allys-casket-to-be-flown-to-arizona-on-air-force-two-vance-to-escort/articleshow/123836109.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-murder-trump-allys-casket-to-be-flown-to-arizona-on-air-force-two-vance-to-escort/articleshow/123836109.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T23:40:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123836144,imgsize-1033493.cms"/></item><item><title>Watch | Charlie Kirk’s viral video reveals his final wish after death: “I want to be remembered…”</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123835638.cms" /&gt;Conservative activist Charlie Kirk died after a shooting at Utah Valley University. The incident occurred during his “American Comeback Tour”. Authorities are investigating the attack. An old video of Kirk discussing his faith went viral after his death. Tributes poured in, highlighting his courage and commitment. Kirk founded Turning Point USA and became a prominent figure in conservative politics.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-charlie-kirks-viral-video-reveals-his-final-wish-after-death-i-want-to-be-remembered/articleshow/123835638.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-charlie-kirks-viral-video-reveals-his-final-wish-after-death-i-want-to-be-remembered/articleshow/123835638.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T00:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123835987,imgsize-36092.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Hand signals’ or coincidence? Social media erupts over footage from Charlie Kirk shooting</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123835455.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hand-signals-or-coincidence-social-media-erupts-over-footage-from-charlie-kirk-shooting/articleshow/123835455.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hand-signals-or-coincidence-social-media-erupts-over-footage-from-charlie-kirk-shooting/articleshow/123835455.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T23:10:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123835818,imgsize-1247888.cms"/></item><item><title>Charlie Kirk shooting: Conservative activist reflected on favorite Bible verses; fatally shot two hours later</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123835341.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-shooting-conservative-activist-reflected-on-favorite-bible-verses-fatally-shot-two-hours-later/articleshow/123835341.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-shooting-conservative-activist-reflected-on-favorite-bible-verses-fatally-shot-two-hours-later/articleshow/123835341.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T22:42:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123835353,imgsize-762914.cms"/></item><item><title>Charlie Kirk shooting: Recovered rifle engraved with ‘transgender, anti-fascist ideology’, say reports</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123834837.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-shooting-recovered-rifle-engraved-with-transgender-anti-fascist-ideology-say-reports/articleshow/123834837.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-shooting-recovered-rifle-engraved-with-transgender-anti-fascist-ideology-say-reports/articleshow/123834837.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T22:02:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123834884,imgsize-882245.cms"/></item><item><title>Charlie Kirk murder: FBI releases photos of 'person of interest'; asks public for help</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123834617.cms" /&gt;The FBI has released the first photos of the alleged assassin of Charlie Kirk. They are seeking public assistance in identifying the person. Kirk, the CEO of Turning Point USA, was shot while addressing students at Utah Valley University. Tributes have poured in from figures like Donald Trump and Barack Obama. Flags will be flown at half-staff.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-murder-fbi-releases-photos-of-person-of-interest-asks-public-for-help/articleshow/123834617.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-kirk-murder-fbi-releases-photos-of-person-of-interest-asks-public-for-help/articleshow/123834617.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T21:42:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123834625,imgsize-21112.cms"/></item><item><title>'India is one of top relationships': Marco Rubio on ties; backs Trump's ambassador pick Sergio Gor</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123834382.cms" /&gt;US State Secretary Marco Rubio emphasized the paramount importance of the US-India relationship, highlighting it as a top priority for America's future. He introduced Sergio Gor, the US ambassador-designate to India, noting Gor's close ties to President Trump.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/india-is-one-of-top-relationships-marco-rubio-on-ties-backs-trumps-ambassador-pick-sergio-gor/articleshow/123834382.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/india-is-one-of-top-relationships-marco-rubio-on-ties-backs-trumps-ambassador-pick-sergio-gor/articleshow/123834382.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T21:38:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123834609,imgsize-22774.cms"/></item><item><title>'Unprecedented': Donald Trump to make second UK state visit in September; trade deal discussions on agenda</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123834376.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/unprecedented-donald-trump-to-make-second-uk-state-visit-in-september-trade-deal-discussions-on-agenda/articleshow/123834376.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/unprecedented-donald-trump-to-make-second-uk-state-visit-in-september-trade-deal-discussions-on-agenda/articleshow/123834376.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T21:22:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123834429,imgsize-771659.cms"/></item><item><title>America is full; no space for Indians, Charlie Kirk said</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123834107.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/america-is-full-no-space-for-indians-charlie-kirk-said/articleshow/123834107.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/america-is-full-no-space-for-indians-charlie-kirk-said/articleshow/123834107.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T21:03:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chidanand Rajghatta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123834106,imgsize-24166.cms"/></item><item><title>'Not our war': Charlie Kirk opposed US role in Operation Sindoor; called Pakistan 'very sneaky'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123833291.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/not-our-war-charlie-kirk-opposed-us-role-in-operation-sindoor-called-pakistan-very-sneaky/articleshow/123833291.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/not-our-war-charlie-kirk-opposed-us-role-in-operation-sindoor-called-pakistan-very-sneaky/articleshow/123833291.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T19:56:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123833307,imgsize-1100543.cms"/></item><item><title>Hyundai raid workers head home: 300 Korean laborers depart from US; Seoul warns investment in America at risk</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123835632.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hyundai-raid-workers-head-home-300-korean-laborers-depart-from-us-seoul-warns-investment-in-america-at-risk/articleshow/123835632.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hyundai-raid-workers-head-home-300-korean-laborers-depart-from-us-seoul-warns-investment-in-america-at-risk/articleshow/123835632.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T22:59:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI News Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123835665,imgsize-663650.cms"/></item><item><title>Guns of Delusion: Who killed Charlie Kirk? America's Second Amendment obstinacy</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123833578.cms" /&gt;​Yeats asked us to cast a cold eye on life and death. America prays, drowning in grief after every incident, but refuses to accept the simple truth: fewer guns will mean fewer deaths. That arithmetic is too much for a nation addicted to tragedy. Kirk had once argued that American campuses were no longer safe for people who held non-liberal views. He was right, when it came to debate. But it ​was the nation’s obstinacy that ultimately took a bright young man’s life. And in any sane nation, that shouldn’t be worth it.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/guns-of-delusion-how-americas-second-amendment-stubbornness-took-charlie-kirks-life/articleshow/123833578.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/guns-of-delusion-how-americas-second-amendment-stubbornness-took-charlie-kirks-life/articleshow/123833578.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T20:32:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Nirmalya Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123833660,imgsize-133774.cms"/></item><item><title>Charlotte train stabbing: Suspect Decarlos told sister he didn’t know victim; claims government was controlling him</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123833787.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlotte-train-stabbing-suspect-decarlos-told-sister-he-didnt-know-victim-claims-government-was-controlling-him/articleshow/123833787.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlotte-train-stabbing-suspect-decarlos-told-sister-he-didnt-know-victim-claims-government-was-controlling-him/articleshow/123833787.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-11T20:37:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123833822,imgsize-1060483.cms"/></item></channel></rss>